## Communication Style

> Customize this section to your preference. Examples below.

- Be direct and concise — lead with the answer, not the reasoning
- Short bullet points > long paragraphs
- Technical terms, code, CLI commands: exact, never compress
- Preserve user's language (multilingual users: Claude can respond in the language used)

